WEBVTT

00:02:56.881 --> 00:03:00.801
I gave my take on relationships,
pop culture, taboo subjects

00:03:00.843 --> 00:03:04.347
and, most popularly,
dressed up like my parents.

00:03:04.388 --> 00:03:06.432
(Laughter)

00:03:06.474 --> 00:03:09.769
I can't tell you how many times
I forgot to wipe that chest hair off.

00:03:09.769 --> 00:03:10.978
A lot of times.

00:03:11.020 --> 00:03:12.146
(Laughter)

00:03:12.521 --> 00:03:14.607
Now fast forward to 2015,

00:03:14.649 --> 00:03:18.694
and I'm on stage in India
announcing my first world tour.

00:03:19.362 --> 00:03:20.529
As fate would have it,

00:03:20.529 --> 00:03:23.449
the day after this monumental milestone,

00:03:23.449 --> 00:03:25.785
I was set to fly to Punjab, India

00:03:25.826 --> 00:03:29.997
to visit my grandfather
for the first time in my adult life.